  "changes": [
    "Failed-load menu binds Retry through RelayCommand/ButtonBinder, with VisibilityBinder selecting Resume for normal pause or Retry for failed load. Existing Exit remains.",
    "SliceBootstrap.Retry enters the existing ExitOriginalLevel and waits for the captured SliceExitStatus.Completed before calling the normal Enter path. SceneLease release, AssetBatch release, Framework shutdown and native service destruction remain production-owned.",
    "A short Bootstrap-owned Unity coroutine spans Framework shutdown; it is not a second gameplay state machine or resource/scene loader. No Framework module is requested in the shutdown gap.",
    "Stale menu commands and repeated retry calls cannot queue extra sessions. Explicit Exit, Bootstrap destruction or application quit prevents pending automatic reentry."
  ],
